{{ template "header" .}}
<h1 class="h2">流量质量审查</h1><p class="text-muted">这里只显示当前账户或已授权范围内的审查结果。系统错误、超时和格式错误不会自动被认定为无效流量。</p>{{with .Other.QualityMessage}}<div class="alert alert-success">{{.}}</div>{{end}}
{{with .Other.QualityScope}}<p>审查范围：<strong>{{.Type}} {{.ID}}</strong></p>{{end}}
<div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm table-striped"><thead><tr><th>案件</th><th>规则与信号</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>动作</th><th>状态</th><th>申诉</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{range .Other.QualityCases}}<tr><td>#{{.ID}}<br><small>{{.ObservedAt}}</small></td><td><code>{{.RuleKey}}@{{.RuleVersion}}</code><br>{{.Signal}} / {{.ReasonCode}}</td><td>{{.Evidence}}；观测值 {{printf "%.6f" .ObservedValue}}，阈值 {{printf "%.6f" .Threshold}}{{if .SafeSummary.Valid}}<br>{{.SafeSummary.String}}{{end}}</td><td>{{.ConfiguredAction}} → {{.AppliedAction}}</td><td>{{.Status}}（v{{.Version}}）</td><td>{{if and $.Other.QualityCanAppeal (eq .Status "InvalidTraffic")}}<form method="post" action="trafficquality?action=appeal">{{$.Other.CSRFInput}}<input type="hidden" name="case_id" value="{{.ID}}"><input type="hidden" name="case_version" value="{{.Version}}"><input type="hidden" name="adv_id" value="{{.Scope.ID}}"><input type="hidden" name="pub_id" value="{{.Scope.ID}}"><input name="reason" maxlength="500" placeholder="请说明申诉理由" required><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" type="submit">提交申诉</button></form>{{else}}—{{end}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="6">当前范围暂无可查看的审查案件。</td></tr>{{end}}</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="h4">执行状态</h2><table class="table table-sm"><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>动作</th><th>状态</th><th>灰度比例</th><th>到期时间</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{range .Other.QualityEnforcements}}<tr><td>{{.ID}}</td><td>{{.Action}}</td><td>{{.State}}</td><td>{{.CanaryBasisPoints}} bp</td><td>{{.ExpiresAt}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="5">暂无执行记录。</td></tr>{{end}}</tbody></table>
{{ template "footer" .}}
